*All Things Work Together*



*Romans 8:28 (KJV) *
And we know that all things work together for good to them that love God,
to them who are called according to his purpose.



*Two Conditions to Activate Romans 8:28*


*1. You have to LOVE God*


*Matthew 22:37-38 (KJV) *
Jesus said unto him, Thou shalt love the Lord thy God with all thy heart,
and with all thy soul, and with all thy mind. 38  This is the first and
great commandment.



*Three Simple TEST to see if You Love God*



=C2=B7       *If you Really Love Him =E2=80=93 You will Crave to be with Hi=
m. *



=C2=B7       *If you LOVE Him =E2=80=93 You will have a Passion to Give to =
Him*



=C2=B7       *You will have a Passion to Praise Him*



*Psalm 150:6 (KJV) *
Let every thing that hath breath praise the LORD. Praise ye the LORD.


*Psalm 27:4 (KJV)*

One thing have I desired of the LORD, that will I seek after; that I may
dwell in the house of the LORD all the days of my life, to behold the
beauty of the LORD, and to enquire in his temple.





 *Psalm 73:25 (KJV)*

Whom have I in heaven but thee? and there is none upon earth that I desire
beside thee.



*Romans 8:28 (KJV) *
And we know that all things work together for good to them that love God,
to them who are the called according to his purpose.



*2. You are Called According to His Purpose*



*II Timothy 1:9 (KJV) says:

                                                          *Who hath saved
us, and called us with an holy calling, not according to our works, but
according to his own purpose and grace.



*Romans 8:28 (KJV) *
And we know that all things work together for good to them that love God,
to them who are the called according to his purpose.


